<main id="main">
  <section class="hero" id="top" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
    <div class="container campaign-line"><span data-t="campaign">CAMPAIGN D · LOCAL CHAINS & OPERATORS</span><span class="region"><span class="tiny-dot"></span><span data-t="region">FOR SAUDI HOTEL GROUPS</span></span></div>
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="line"></span><span data-t="hero.eyebrow">YOUR GROUP. ONE TECHNOLOGY STRATEGY.</span></p>
        <h1 id="hero-heading" data-t="hero.title">A dedicated platform.<br>Built around<br><em>your hotel group.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-lead" data-t="hero.lead">Explore a dedicated Fandaqah environment with agreed branding, workflows, integrations and group reporting.</p>
        <p class="hero-detail" data-t="hero.detail">Standardise supported processes across your properties with one accountable technology partner and a clearly scoped implementation plan.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#discovery"><span data-t="cta.main">Book a group discovery meeting</span><svg class="icon arrow"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a><button class="story-open text-button" type="button"><span class="play-circle"><svg class="icon"><use href="#play"/></svg></span><span data-t="hero.story">See the group story</span><small>25s</small></button></div>
        <p class="fit-note"><svg class="icon"><use href="#building"/></svg><span data-t="hero.fit">For owners and operators responsible for about <strong>10 or more properties.</strong></span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art">
        <div class="portfolio-photo"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high" alt="Illustrative architectural scene of three Saudi hotel properties linked by one coral thread." data-alt="hero.imageAlt"><div class="photo-caption"><span class="tiny-dot"></span><span data-t="hero.caption">A portfolio of properties. A shared direction.</span></div><span class="art-number" aria-hidden="true">D / 360</span></div>
        <div class="hero-system">
          <div class="hero-board"><div class="mini-board-top"><span class="mini-brand"><svg class="icon"><use href="#layers"/></svg><span data-t="hero.boardScope">Group overview</span></span><span class="sample-badge" data-t="hero.sample">ILLUSTRATIVE GROUP VIEW</span></div><div class="mini-board-body"><div><h2 data-t="hero.boardTitle">Your group, in focus.</h2><p data-t="hero.boardSub">One view. Property-level detail.</p></div><div class="mini-stats"><div><strong>12</strong><span data-t="hero.12">Sample properties</span></div><div><strong>03</strong><span data-t="hero.3">Property views shown</span></div><div class="mini-chart" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--h:35%"></i><i style="--h:50%"></i><i style="--h:42%"></i><i style="--h:70%"></i><i style="--h:58%"></i><i style="--h:86%"></i><i style="--h:78%"></i></div></div><div class="mini-foot"><span class="tiny-dot"></span><span data-t="hero.branding">Illustrative branding · Sample data</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="property-connectors" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="hero-properties"><a href="#platform" class="hero-property" data-select="riyadh"><span class="property-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#building"/></svg></span><div><strong data-t="city.riyadh">Riyadh</strong><span data-t="hero.propView">Property dashboard</span></div><span class="node-dot"></span></a><a href="#platform" class="hero-property" data-select="jeddah"><span class="property-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#building"/></svg></span><div><strong data-t="city.jeddah">Jeddah</strong><span data-t="hero.propView">Property dashboard</span></div><span class="node-dot"></span></a><a href="#platform" class="hero-property" data-select="khobar"><span class="property-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#building"/></svg></span><div><strong data-t="city.khobar">Al Khobar</strong><span data-t="hero.propView">Property dashboard</span></div><span class="node-dot"></span></a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container principles"><div><span class="index">01 /</span><div><h2 data-t="principle1.title">Your brand.</h2><p data-t="principle1.text">An identity agreed with your group.</p></div></div><div><span class="index">02 /</span><div><h2 data-t="principle2.title">Your policies.</h2><p data-t="principle2.text">Supported workflows, aligned to your standards.</p></div></div><div><span class="index">03 /</span><div><h2 data-t="principle3.title">Your technology.</h2><p data-t="principle3.text">One accountable technology partnership.</p></div></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section intro" aria-labelledby="intro-heading"><div class="container two-col"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-t="intro.kicker">BUILT AROUND THE WAY YOU OPERATE</p><h2 id="intro-heading" data-t="intro.title">Many properties.<br><em>One shared direction.</em></h2></div><div class="intro-right"><p class="lead" data-t="intro.lead">A dedicated hotel technology platform built around your group.</p><p data-t="intro.text">Your properties may serve different guests, in different cities, under different operating structures. Start with a shared technology strategy that respects those differences.</p><ul class="editorial-list"><li><span>01</span><span data-t="intro.point1">See the group and each property clearly.</span></li><li><span>02</span><span data-t="intro.point2">Align supported workflows with your brand.</span></li><li><span>03</span><span data-t="intro.point3">Agree the scope, responsibilities and rollout together.</span></li></ul></div></div></section>
  <section class="section platform" id="platform" aria-labelledby="platform-heading"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading two-col"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-t="platform.kicker">FROM GROUP OVERVIEW TO PROPERTY DETAIL</p><h2 id="platform-heading" data-t="platform.title">The bigger picture.<br><em>The detail that matters.</em></h2></div><p class="section-description" data-t="platform.text">Explore this illustrative dashboard. Choose a property to see how a group view could connect to local operational detail.</p></div>
    <div class="dashboard">
      <div class="dashboard-top"><div class="dashboard-brand"><span class="group-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon"><use href="#layers"/></svg></span><span data-t="demo.groupName">YOUR HOTEL GROUP</span></div><span class="branding-label"><span class="tiny-dot"></span><span data-t="demo.sample">Illustrative branding</span></span></div>
      <div class="dashboard-shell"><div class="dashboard-side"><span class="dash-side-kicker" data-t="demo.overview">Portfolio overview</span><div class="scope-tabs" role="tablist" data-aria="aria.scope" aria-label="Dashboard scope" aria-orientation="vertical"><button role="tab" id="tab-group" aria-controls="dashboard-panel" aria-selected="true" data-scope="group"><svg class="icon"><use href="#grid"/></svg><span data-t="demo.group">Group overview</span><span class="tab-count">12</span></button><button role="tab" id="tab-riyadh" aria-controls="dashboard-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-scope="riyadh"><svg class="icon"><use href="#building"/></svg><span data-t="city.riyadh">Riyadh</span><span class="tab-count">01</span></button><button role="tab" id="tab-jeddah" aria-controls="dashboard-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-scope="jeddah"><svg class="icon"><use href="#building"/></svg><span data-t="city.jeddah">Jeddah</span><span class="tab-count">02</span></button><button role="tab" id="tab-khobar" aria-controls="dashboard-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-scope="khobar"><svg class="icon"><use href="#building"/></svg><span data-t="city.khobar">Al Khobar</span><span class="tab-count">03</span></button></div><div class="sidebar-property-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="building-one"></div><div class="building-two"></div><div class="building-three"></div><span>360</span></div><p class="dash-side-note" data-t="demo.sampleData">SAMPLE DATA · NOT A LIVE PRODUCT SCREEN</p></div>
      <div class="dashboard-content" id="dashboard-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-group" tabindex="0"><div class="dash-heading"><div><p id="scope-eyebrow" data-t="demo.overview">Portfolio overview</p><h3 id="scope-title" data-t="demo.group">Group overview</h3></div><span class="period"><span class="tiny-dot"></span><span data-t="demo.period">Sample week</span></span></div><div class="metrics" aria-live="polite"><div><span data-t="demo.properties">Properties in view</span><strong id="metric-properties">12<span>/ 12</span></strong></div><div><span data-t="demo.occupancy">Sample occupancy</span><strong id="metric-occupancy">76<span>%</span></strong></div><div><span data-t="demo.reports">Reports available</span><strong id="metric-reports">9<span>/ 12</span></strong></div></div>
      <div class="dash-chart-row"><div class="chart-panel"><div class="chart-heading"><h4 data-t="demo.chart">Occupancy by day</h4><span id="chart-scope" data-t="demo.group">Group overview</span></div><div class="bar-chart" role="img" data-aria="demo.chartLabel" aria-label="Illustrative occupancy percentages over seven days"><div class="chart-guides" aria-hidden="true"><span>100%</span><span>50%</span><span>0%</span></div><div class="chart-bars" id="chart-bars"><div><i style="--bar:64%"></i><span data-t="day.mon">M</span></div><div><i style="--bar:69%"></i><span data-t="day.tue">T</span></div><div><i style="--bar:72%"></i><span data-t="day.wed">W</span></div><div><i style="--bar:76%"></i><span data-t="day.thu">T</span></div><div><i style="--bar:83%"></i><span data-t="day.fri">F</span></div><div><i style="--bar:91%"></i><span data-t="day.sat">S</span></div><div><i style="--bar:77%"></i><span data-t="day.sun">S</span></div></div></div></div><div class="workflow-panel"><h4 data-t="demo.progress">Illustrative reporting workflow</h4><ol><li><span>1</span><span data-t="demo.progress1">Property prepares</span></li><li><span>2</span><span data-t="demo.progress2">Group reviews</span></li><li><span>3</span><span data-t="demo.progress3">Finance approves</span></li></ol><span class="workflow-tag" data-t="demo.sample">Illustrative branding</span></div></div>
      <div class="property-table-wrap"><table class="property-table"><caption data-t="demo.summary">Property reporting</caption><thead><tr><th data-t="demo.property">Property</th><th data-t="demo.occupancyShort">Occupancy</th><th data-t="demo.status">Sample status</th></tr></thead><tbody id="property-rows"><tr data-property-row="riyadh"><th><span class="table-square">01</span><span data-t="city.riyadh">Riyadh</span></th><td>81%</td><td><span class="status-tag" data-t="demo.review">For group review</span></td></tr><tr data-property-row="jeddah"><th><span class="table-square">02</span><span data-t="city.jeddah">Jeddah</span></th><td>74%</td><td><span class="status-tag" data-t="demo.review">For group review</span></td></tr><tr data-property-row="khobar"><th><span class="table-square">03</span><span data-t="city.khobar">Al Khobar</span></th><td>72%</td><td><span class="status-tag pending" data-t="demo.preparing">In preparation</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="dashboard-note" id="dashboard-note" data-t="demo.tableNote">Three of twelve example properties shown. All names, values and workflows are illustrative.</p>
      </div></div>
    </div><p class="scope-note"><span class="scope-note-icon">i</span><span data-t="platform.note">Concept demonstration only. Deployment, customisation, branding, metrics and supported integrations are agreed in the proposal.</span></p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section brand-section" id="your-group" aria-labelledby="brand-heading"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow" data-t="brand.kicker">YOUR BRAND. YOUR POLICIES. YOUR HOTEL TECHNOLOGY.</p><h2 id="brand-heading" data-t="brand.title">Dedicated to your group.<br><em>Defined together.</em></h2><p class="max-copy" data-t="brand.text">Build your hospitality technology partnership with Fandaqah. Agree what your group needs, what is supported and how it will be delivered.</p></div><div class="brand-grid"><div class="identity-preview"><span class="identity-kicker" data-t="brand.sample">Illustrative branding</span><h3 data-t="brand.previewTitle">A platform that feels<br>like your group.</h3><div class="brand-window"><div class="brand-window-bar"><span class="identity-symbol"><svg class="icon"><use href="#layers"/></svg></span><strong data-t="brand.previewName">YOUR HOTEL GROUP</strong><span class="window-user">G</span></div><div class="brand-window-body"><span class="preview-line long"></span><span class="preview-line"></span><div class="preview-cards"><span><i></i><b></b></span><span><i></i><b></b></span><span><i></i><b></b></span></div><div class="preview-chart" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 100"><path d="M0 85 40 75 80 79 120 54 160 61 200 39 240 48 280 17 320 26 360 12 400 5"/></svg></div><p data-t="brand.previewBody">Your identity. Agreed workflows. A shared view.</p></div></div><div class="identity-tags"><span data-t="brand.tag1">Group identity</span><span data-t="brand.tag2">Defined permissions</span><span data-t="brand.tag3">Supported workflows</span></div></div>
    <div class="brand-explainer"><details class="feature-detail" open><summary><span class="detail-num">01</span><h3 data-t="brand.a1.title">Branding & supported workflows</h3><svg class="icon"><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p data-t="brand.a1.text">Agree the visual identity and the supported operational processes your group wants to standardise. Customisation is delivered to an agreed scope, with clear acceptance criteria.</p></details><details class="feature-detail"><summary><span class="detail-num">02</span><h3 data-t="brand.a2.title">Reporting & permissions</h3><svg class="icon"><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p data-t="brand.a2.text">Map group reporting, property-level views and who can see, change or approve information. Define the responsibilities of group teams and property teams before rollout.</p></details><details class="feature-detail"><summary><span class="detail-num">03</span><h3 data-t="brand.a3.title">Integrations & hosting</h3><svg class="icon"><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p data-t="brand.a3.text">Review your existing systems, required interfaces, deployment approach and data requirements. Confirm technical feasibility, approvals and responsibilities in the proposal.</p></details><details class="feature-detail"><summary><span class="detail-num">04</span><h3 data-t="brand.a4.title">Support & accountability</h3><svg class="icon"><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p data-t="brand.a4.text">Agree the service model, support responsibilities, training and escalation routes with one accountable technology partner. Define the implementation plan and checkpoints together.</p></details><p class="contract-note" data-t="brand.note">Branding, hosting, customisation and service responsibilities are proposal-specific. Contract terms determine ownership and other rights.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section workshop" id="workshop" aria-labelledby="workshop-heading"><div class="container workshop-grid"><div class="workshop-copy"><p class="eyebrow" data-t="workshop.kicker">THE GROUP DISCOVERY WORKSHOP</p><h2 id="workshop-heading" data-t="workshop.title">A better platform starts<br>with <em>the right questions.</em></h2><p class="lead" data-t="workshop.lead">Bring your owners, operations, IT and finance teams into one focused conversation.</p><p data-t="workshop.text">We will map your property structure, priorities and technology decisions before preparing a scoped proposal. Bring your property list, current systems and reporting requirements.</p><div class="participants"><span data-t="workshop.owner">Owner / CEO</span><span data-t="workshop.ops">COO / Operations</span><span data-t="workshop.it">IT</span><span data-t="workshop.finance">Finance</span></div><div class="workshop-outcome"><svg class="icon"><use href="#layers"/></svg><div><span class="eyebrow" data-t="workshop.outcomeLabel">WHAT YOU LEAVE WITH</span><p data-t="workshop.outcome">A documented group brief and agreed next steps toward a clearly scoped proposal.</p></div></div><a class="button button-navy" href="#discovery"><span data-t="cta.main">Book a group discovery meeting</span><svg class="icon arrow"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></div><ol class="workshop-agenda">
    <li><span>01</span><div><h3 data-t="workshop.1.title">Property structure</h3><p data-t="workshop.1.text">Owned, managed and franchised properties, approximate count and technology purchasing authority.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3 data-t="workshop.2.title">Reports</h3><p data-t="workshop.2.text">The group and property-level information your teams need to review and act on.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3 data-t="workshop.3.title">Permissions</h3><p data-t="workshop.3.text">Who sees what, who approves what and which decisions stay with each property.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><h3 data-t="workshop.4.title">Integrations</h3><p data-t="workshop.4.text">Current systems, required interfaces, feasibility and the approval process.</p></div></li><li><span>05</span><div><h3 data-t="workshop.5.title">Hosting</h3><p data-t="workshop.5.text">Deployment preferences, data requirements and agreed responsibilities.</p></div></li><li><span>06</span><div><h3 data-t="workshop.6.title">Support</h3><p data-t="workshop.6.text">Service expectations, escalation routes, training and accountable owners.</p></div></li><li><span>07</span><div><h3 data-t="workshop.7.title">Implementation</h3><p data-t="workshop.7.text">An agreed pilot, rollout sequence, acceptance criteria and success measures.</p></div></li>
  </ol></div></section>
  <section class="section journey" id="implementation" aria-labelledby="journey-heading"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading two-col"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-t="journey.kicker">A CLEAR PATH FROM CONVERSATION TO ROLLOUT</p><h2 id="journey-heading" data-t="journey.title">Start with alignment.<br><em>Expand with a plan.</em></h2></div><p class="section-description" data-t="journey.text">Define the work, test it with agreed properties and expand through documented checkpoints.</p></div><ol class="journey-steps"><li><div class="step-top"><span>01</span></div><h3 data-t="journey.1.title">Discover</h3><p data-t="journey.1.text">Confirm the group structure, decision-makers, priorities and requirements.</p><span class="step-output"><svg class="icon"><use href="#check"/></svg><span data-t="journey.1.output">A documented group brief</span></span></li><li><div class="step-top"><span>02</span></div><h3 data-t="journey.2.title">Scope</h3><p data-t="journey.2.text">Agree deliverables, interfaces, responsibilities, commercials and acceptance criteria.</p><span class="step-output"><svg class="icon"><use href="#check"/></svg><span data-t="journey.2.output">A clearly scoped proposal</span></span></li><li><div class="step-top"><span>03</span></div><h3 data-t="journey.3.title">Pilot</h3><p data-t="journey.3.text">Validate agreed workflows with selected properties before wider implementation.</p><span class="step-output"><svg class="icon"><use href="#check"/></svg><span data-t="journey.3.output">An agreed pilot review</span></span></li><li><div class="step-top"><span>04</span></div><h3 data-t="journey.4.title">Roll out</h3><p data-t="journey.4.text">Expand in agreed phases with training, support and implementation checkpoints.</p><span class="step-output"><svg class="icon"><use href="#check"/></svg><span data-t="journey.4.output">A group rollout plan</span></span></li></ol><div class="commercials"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-t="price.kicker">CLEAR COMMERCIALS</p><h3 data-t="price.title">A proposal with every part in view.</h3><p data-t="price.text">Setup, ongoing service and agreed customisation are priced separately. Your property structure and agreed requirements determine the proposal.</p></div><div class="price-components"><span><b>01</b><span data-t="price.1">Setup & implementation</span></span><span><b>02</b><span data-t="price.2">Ongoing service</span></span><span><b>03</b><span data-t="price.3">Agreed customisation</span></span></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading"><div class="container faq-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow" data-t="faq.kicker">BEFORE WE MEET</p><h2 id="faq-heading" data-t="faq.title">Good questions.<br><em>Clear expectations.</em></h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details class="faq-item"><summary><span data-t="faq.1.q">Who is this group platform for?</span><svg class="icon"><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p data-t="faq.1.a">Local hotel operators, group owners and asset managers responsible for about 10 or more properties, with group-level operations, IT and finance involvement. We confirm managed, owned and franchised properties and who controls technology purchasing. A DMC is relevant only if it manages accommodation assets or technology decisions.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary><span data-t="faq.2.q">How much can we customise?</span><svg class="icon"><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p data-t="faq.2.a">Customisation is delivered to an agreed scope. Branding, supported workflows, integrations and reporting requirements are assessed during discovery and documented in the proposal, with responsibilities and acceptance criteria.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary><span data-t="faq.3.q">Does white labelling transfer source-code ownership?</span><svg class="icon"><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p data-t="faq.3.a">White labelling does not imply transfer of source-code ownership, unlimited changes or exclusivity. Your contract determines branding rights, ownership, hosting and other commercial terms.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary><span data-t="faq.4.q">Can we connect existing systems?</span><svg class="icon"><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p data-t="faq.4.a">We review your current systems and required interfaces, including technical feasibility, approvals, implementation effort and ongoing responsibilities. Only supported, agreed integrations are included in the proposal.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary><span data-t="faq.5.q">How is the group proposal priced?</span><svg class="icon"><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p data-t="faq.5.a">Setup, ongoing service and agreed customisation are priced separately. The proposal reflects the property structure, deployment approach, supported interfaces and implementation scope agreed with your group.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary><span data-t="faq.6.q">What happens before a wider rollout?</span><svg class="icon"><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p data-t="faq.6.a">We agree the pilot properties, supported workflows, acceptance criteria and implementation checkpoints. The pilot review informs the next rollout phase and training plan.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary><span data-t="faq.7.q">Can we include AI use cases?</span><svg class="icon"><use href="#plus"/></svg></summary><p data-t="faq.7.a">AI is demonstrated only through approved working use cases. Any proposed use case must be reviewed, validated and explicitly included in the agreed scope.</p></details></div></div></section>
  <section class="section contact" id="discovery" aria-labelledby="contact-heading"><div class="container contact-grid"><div class="contact-copy"><p class="eyebrow" data-t="contact.kicker">YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2 id="contact-heading" data-t="contact.title">Bring your group<br><em>into focus.</em></h2><p data-t="contact.text">Discuss a dedicated technology platform with the people responsible for your group’s operations, IT and finance.</p><div class="contact-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span class="orbit-center"><svg class="icon"><use href="#layers"/></svg></span><span class="orbit-node node1"><svg class="icon"><use href="#building"/></svg></span><span class="orbit-node node2"><svg class="icon"><use href="#building"/></svg></span><span class="orbit-node node3"><svg class="icon"><use href="#building"/></svg></span><span class="orbit-node node4"><svg class="icon"><use href="#building"/></svg></span></div><p class="contact-note" data-t="contact.note">One group. One coordinated conversation.</p><div class="direct-email"><span data-t="contact.email">Prefer email?</span><a href="mailto:info@fandaqah.com">info@fandaqah.com <svg class="icon arrow"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></div></div>
    <div class="meeting-card"><h3 data-t="form.title">Let’s plan your group platform.</h3><p class="form-subtitle" data-t="form.subtitle">Tell us a little about your group. Review your brief, then open an email to arrange a discovery meeting.</p><ol class="form-progress" data-aria="aria.progress" aria-label="Meeting request progress"><li class="active" data-progress="1"><b>1</b><span data-t="form.step1">Your group</span></li><li data-progress="2"><b>2</b><span data-t="form.step2">Your details</span></li><li data-progress="3"><b>3</b><span data-t="form.step3">Review</span></li></ol><form id="meeting-form" novalidate>
      <fieldset data-step="1"><legend class="sr-only" data-t="form.step1">Your group</legend><label for="company" data-t="form.company">Group / company name</label><input id="company" name="company" required minlength="2" maxlength="150" autocomplete="organization"><label for="city" data-t="form.city">Headquarters city</label><input id="city" name="city" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="address-level2"><div class="form-row"><div><label for="property-count" data-t="form.count">Number of properties</label><select id="property-count" name="count" required><option value="" data-t="form.select">Please select</option><option value="under10" data-t="form.under10">Under 10</option><option value="count10" data-t="form.count10">10–20</option><option value="count21" data-t="form.count21">21–50</option><option value="count51" data-t="form.count51">More than 50</option></select></div><div><label for="structure" data-t="form.structure">Property structure</label><select id="structure" name="structure" required><option value="" data-t="form.select">Please select</option><option value="managed" data-t="form.managed">Managed</option><option value="owned" data-t="form.owned">Owned</option><option value="franchised" data-t="form.franchised">Franchised</option><option value="mixed" data-t="form.mixed">Mixed</option></select></div></div><button class="button form-next" type="button" data-next="2"><span data-t="form.next">Continue to your details</span><svg class="icon arrow"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button></fieldset>
      <fieldset data-step="2" hidden disabled><legend class="sr-only" data-t="form.step2">Your details</legend><div class="form-row"><div><label for="contact-name" data-t="form.name">Contact name</label><input id="contact-name" name="name" required minlength="2" maxlength="120" autocomplete="name"></div><div><label for="role" data-t="form.role">Your role</label><input id="role" name="role" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="organization-title"></div></div><label for="business-email" data-t="form.email">Business email</label><input id="business-email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="180" autocomplete="email" dir="ltr"><label for="phone" data-t="form.phone">Mobile number</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" required maxlength="30" autocomplete="tel" dir="ltr" placeholder="05XXXXXXXX"><label for="priority" data-t="form.priority">Your group’s main priority (optional)</label><textarea id="priority" name="priority" rows="2" maxlength="1500" placeholder="For example, group reporting or supported workflows" data-placeholder="form.priorityPlaceholder"></textarea><div class="sr-only" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website <input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><div class="form-buttons"><button class="text-button" type="button" data-back="1" data-t="form.back">Back</button><button class="button" type="submit"><span data-t="form.review">Review meeting request</span><svg class="icon arrow"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button></div></fieldset>
      <div data-step="3" hidden><h4 tabindex="-1" id="review-heading" data-t="form.reviewTitle">Your discovery meeting brief</h4><dl class="review-list" id="review-list"></dl><p class="review-note" data-t="form.reviewNote">Check your details, then send your request. Our team will contact you to arrange the meeting.</p><button type="button" id="send-request" class="button"><svg class="icon"><use href="#mail"/></svg><span data-t="form.send">Send my meeting request</span><svg class="icon arrow"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button><div class="review-actions"><button type="button" class="text-button" data-back="2" data-t="form.back">Back</button><button type="button" id="download-brief" class="text-button" data-t="form.download">Download the brief</button><a id="email-request" class="text-button" href="mailto:info@fandaqah.com" data-t="form.openEmail">Email it instead</a></div></div><div data-step="4" class="form-done" hidden><span class="form-done-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="icon"><use href="#check"/></svg></span><h4 tabindex="-1" id="done-heading" data-t="form.doneTitle">Thank you. Your request is with our team.</h4><p class="review-note" data-t="form.doneText">A Fandaqah specialist will contact you shortly to arrange your discovery meeting.</p><p class="form-ref"><span data-t="form.ref">Reference:</span> <b dir="ltr" id="form-ref"></b></p></div>
      <p id="form-alert" class="form-alert" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="form-privacy"><svg class="icon"><use href="#check"/></svg><span data-t="form.privacy">Your details are sent securely to Fandaqah’s customer relationship system and used only to arrange your meeting.</span></p>
    </form><noscript><p>Please email your group’s requirements to <a href="mailto:info@fandaqah.com">info@fandaqah.com</a>. إرسال متطلبات مجموعتك عبر البريد الإلكتروني.</p></noscript></div>
  </div></section>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer"><div class="container footer-top"><div><a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Fandaqah 360"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Fandaqah · فندقة" width="340" height="146" loading="lazy"><span class="brand-360">360</span></a><p data-t="footer.tag">Your hospitality, our priority.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><span data-t="footer.platform">Hotel groups & operators</span><a href="mailto:info@fandaqah.com">info@fandaqah.com</a><a href="https://fandaqah.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">fandaqah.com <svg class="icon arrow"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></div></div><div class="container footer-bottom"><p data-t="footer.scope">Deployment, customisation and branding are agreed in the proposal. All dashboard screens and property data are illustrative.</p><span data-t="footer.rights">© 2026 Fandaqah. All rights reserved.</span></div></footer>
